# Plan execution: Subagent-Driven only

When an implementation plan is ready to execute (after writing-plans or user says go):

- **Always** use Subagent-Driven Development (`superpowers:subagent-driven-development`).
- **Never** ask the user to choose between Subagent-Driven and Inline Execution.
- Do not offer the writing-plans "Which approach?" prompt.

Continue through all plan tasks without pausing for "should I continue?" check-ins.
